# PolicyLens

PolicyLens is an autonomous policy impact assessment agent built using Google ADK and Gemini 3.

## What it does
- Reads a policy document (PDF)
- Reads demographic data (CSV)
- Identifies affected populations
- Assesses risk level
- Recommends mitigation strategies

## Tech Stack
- Google ADK (Agent orchestration)
- Gemini 3 (via Vertex AI)
- Python (FastAPI)
- Google Cloud Storage
- Cursor IDE
- Google Stitch (UI)

## Why it matters
Policy impact analysis is slow and manual. PolicyLens reduces weeks of analysis into seconds using agentic AI.

## Status
Hackathon MVP
